<title>USA: Bank West gets approval for share buyback.</title>
<headline>Bank West gets approval for share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>GRAND RAPIDS, Mich. 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank West Financial Corp said Monday it received approval from the U.S. Office of Thrift Supervision to repurchase up to 89,000 shares or five percent of its outstanding common stock.</p>
<p>The stock repurchase is expected to add to the bank holding company's book value and earnings per share, Bank West said in a statement.</p>
<p>Shares of Bank West were trading off 1/4 to 12-1/4.</p>
<p>		   ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
